# The SSH keys Conch's releases are signed with (ADR 0051, docs/RELEASING.md).
#
# Every Conch checks a release's tag against this list as it is in the
# version already installed, so a release that changes it must be signed by
# a key already here. `pnpm release key` adds the release key the first time.
# Format: principal namespaces="git" <key type> <key> (see ssh-keygen(1), ALLOWED SIGNERS).
conch-release namespaces="git" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIOerv6QBIl1LJ2d/boLYNmpAVMaMxKzPusWX60sZFyF3
